# Cloudflare Pages cache policy (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/)
#
# Goal: a new production deploy is never served stale. HTML and non-hashed
# assets (images, manifest, feed) revalidate on every request, so returning
# visitors always get the latest after a deploy. Astro's content-hashed build
# assets (/_astro/*) change filename on any change, so they cache forever.

/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

# Content-hashed by Astro — safe to cache immutably (rule placed last so it
# wins over /* for these paths).
/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
